    "Reading Luke on Tuesday night while intoxicated ('ripped'), experiencing the Gospel as narrating the real world",
    "Experiencing the spurious autogenerated world of dreams, with a voice reminding him minute-by-minute that it was not real",
    "Seven years of reflection (since ~1974) declaring Acts as the real world",
    "His meta-abstraction (anamnesis) during 2-3-74 as the realization of abstract vs. concrete thinking"
  ],
