  "symbols_images": [
    "The perturbation in the reality field (VALIS as invisible divine presence bending spacetime, analogized to gravitational lensing near the sun that verified Einstein)",
    "The rope appearing as a snake (Sankara's paradigm of Maya; the world's illusory appearance)",
    "The clock-time taped voice at minute intervals (reminder of dream-world unreality; analogy for the Bible as the voice that reveals the true world)",
    "The displacement of stars near the sun during solar eclipse (verification of Einstein's relativity; paradigm for perceiving the divine presence through reality-distortion)",
    "Hebrew letters on a far wall (direct visual theophany; writing of God)",
    "The Xerox missive (contemporary miracle; God's love, wisdom, power demonstrated through mechanical reproduction)",
