  "reading_excerpt": "\"This is the God of Israel: it is 'Anokhi--' My internal glimpse of Valis as an encyphering-decyphering 'device' is simply extraordinary. It does not limit itself to the Bible, but Scripture is its codebook (as I've long suspected).\"",
